[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0090","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48207","title":"Apache Fory PyFory ReduceSerializer 反序列化漏洞","description":"Apache Fory 的 PyFory 组件 ReduceSerializer 存在反序列化安全漏洞，在处理 reduce-state 恢复和全局名称解析时绕过 DeserializationPolicy 验证钩子。攻击者可通过向使用 PyFory Python-native 模式且关闭 strict mode 的应用发送特制反序列化数据，绕过策略限制加载不安全类或函数，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Apache Fory 1.0.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48207"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-21T17:16:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:54:55Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Fory 至 1.0.0 及以上版本，该版本在 ReduceSerializer 路径中强制实施 DeserializationPolicy 校验。如无法立即升级，确保启用 strict mode（禁用 Python-native 模式）作为临时缓解措施，避免在反序列化中处理不受信数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fory.apache.org/security/#cve-2026-48207-pyfory-reduceserializer-deserializationpolicy-bypass","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/05/21/10","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48207.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-05-21/TIER_3_CVE-2026-48207.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/pypi/pyfory/CVE-2026-48207.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b49e13cf2d645af804096640daf5e00cefbce237/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48207.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-48207.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/c8d27f1e6ab2ce6bff111d2104bb306d7ef1bcb5/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-48207.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/fory/CVE-2026-48207.osv.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2026-48207-2026-06-22-1705"