存在源验证漏洞（CWE-346），攻击者需首先获得目标系统上的低权限代码执行能力，随后利用该漏洞绕过进程保护机制，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞与 CVE-2026-34927 类似但存在于不同的进程保护机制中，影响 Apex One 本地部署版（14.0.0.17079 之前版本）及 SaaS 版（14.0.20731 之前版本）。成功利用后可获取系统级权限，完全控制受影响的机密性、完整性和可用性。Trend Micro 已发布安全公告并提供修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34930"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-21T14:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Apex One (on-prem) 升级至 SP1 CP Build 18012（现有 SP1 用户）或 SP1 Build 17079（全新安装），确保 Security Agent 版本 ≥ 14.0.0.17079；Apex One as a Service / Vision One SEP 用户将 Security Agent 升级至 build 14.0.20731。补丁可从 Trend Micro Download Center 获取。临时缓解措施：限制低权限用户对受影响主机的本地访问，审核并收紧远程访问策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://success.trendmicro.com/en-US/solution/KA-0023430","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34930.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34930.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34930.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34930.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34930.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-34930.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-349xx/CVE-2026-34930.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-34930.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-34930","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/