ps://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-34929.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-34929","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-34929"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0959.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0957","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0957.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34928","title":"Trend Micro Apex One SEP 代理本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Trend AI Apex One 及 Vision One SEP（原 Standard Endpoint Protection）Windows 终端安全代理中存在一个基于命名管道的来源验证漏洞（CWE-346）。该漏洞位于 Apex One NT Listener 服务的命名管道通信机制中，服务端未能充分验证客户端命令的来源身份，导致本地低权限攻击者可在已获得低权限代码执行权限的前提下，通过向该命名管道发送特制请求的方式注入并执行特权操作，最终实现本地权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞与 CVE-2026-34927 属于同一漏洞类别，但存在于不同的命名管道通信机制中。受影响的版本包括 Apex One 2019 代理版本低于 17079，以及 Apex One as a Service / Vision One SEP 代理版本低于 14.0.20731 的 Windows 系统。Trend AI 已观测到该漏洞类别的实际在野利用尝试，并已发布安全更新修复此问题，受影响用户应尽快升级至 SP1 CP Build 18012（Apex One 本地部署版）或 Security Agent build 14.0.20731（云服务版）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34928"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-21T14:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:10:00Z","remediation":"将 Apex One 安全代理升级至 SP1 Build 17079（全新安装）或 SP1 CP Build 18012（现有 SP1 用户），Apex One as a Service / Vision One SEP 安全代理升级至 Agent build 14.0.20731。如无法立即更新，应严格限制对受影响系统的物理和远程访问权限作为临时缓解措施，并持续关注 Trend Micro 下载中心（downloadcenter.trendmicro.com）获取最新补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://success.trendmicro.com/en-US/solution/KA-0023430","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34928.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34928.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34928.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34928.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34928.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-34928.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-349xx/CVE-2026-34928.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-34928.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-34928","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-34928"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0957.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0955","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0955.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34927","title":"Trend Micro Apex One/SEP 权限提升漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Apex One 和 Symantec Endpoint Protection (SEP) 代理存在来源验证漏洞（CWE-346），攻击者通过绕过对用户输入或外部数据来源的完整性校验，可在已安装受影响代理的系统上实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Apex One 及 SEP agent 的多个版本，CVSS 评分为 7.8（高危），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），所需权限为低权限（PR:L），无需用户交互（UI:N）。利用条件要求攻击者首先获得在目标系统上执行低权限代码的能力（例如通过已登录的本地会话或已控终端），随后即可利用该来源验证缺陷绕过安全机制，将权限提升至高权限级别，从而完全控制受影响系统。Trend Micro 已在 2026 年 5 月发布安全公告并修复该漏洞，建议受影响用户及时升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34927"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-21T14:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:10:00Z","remediation":"将 Apex One（本地部署版）升级至 SP1 CP Build 18012（已有 SP1 用户）或 SP1 Build 17079（全新安装），并将 Security Agent 升级至至少 14.0.0.17079；将 Apex One as a Service 或 Vision One Standard Endpoint Protection (SEP) 的 Security Agent 升级至 build 14.0.20731。如暂时无法升级，可限制对关键系统的远程访问权限并收紧本地账户权限，降低低权限代码执行风险。升级完成后重启 Apex One NT Listener 服务使修复生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://success.trendmicro.com/en-US/solution/KA-0023430","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-349xx/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-34927.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2026/CVE-2026-34927.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-34927"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0955.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0168","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-9082","title":"Drupal Core PostgreSQL SQL注入漏洞","description":"Drupal Core 的 PostgreSQL 数据库驱动模块中存在 SQL 注入漏洞，由于对用户输入的特殊元素未进行正确的中和过滤，导致攻击者可在无需认证的情况下通过构造恶意 SQL 语句注入数据库查询，实现信息窃取、数据篡改甚至远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Drupal Core 8.9.0 至 11.3.10 之间的多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者利用该漏洞无需用户交互，仅需向受影响系统发送特制请求即可触发。Drupal 官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-9082"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-20T20:16:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T11:04:48Z","remediation":"立即升级 Drupal 核心至以下修复版本：10.4.10、10.5.10、10.6.9、11.1.10、11.2.12 或 11.3.10（取决于当前使用的分支）。同时建议对 PostgreSQL 数据库连接启用最小权限原则，并开启 Drupal 的查询参数化预处理功能。如无法立即升级，可在数据库层面配置 pg_stat_statements 监控异常 SQL 查询。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.drupal.org/sa-core-2026-004","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-9082","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52608","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/thinhap/CVE-2026-9082-PoC","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-9082.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9426659ffb94439885c8f9a7072893bb232e3620/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/e52a2c3eaf2fb0befc721cf0919d07ea435a23b4/2026/06/Drupal-CVE-2026-9082-sql%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5/Drupal-CVE-2026-9082-sql%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-9082.md","https://github.com/7h30th3r0n3/CVE-2026-9082-Drupal-PoC/blob/8b2a4499cdf1a0ed1da14499ae1baf06bcabcddd/CVE-2026-9082.py","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/9c43ebfe5fc7139bd09b5d01c99b1e7e4a2b98a1/appsec-rules/crowdsecurity/vpatch-CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/83879d08c2f585144b422608ddded5791c854432/src/content/changelog/waf/2026-06-09-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2026/9xxx/CVE-2026-9082.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-9082/drupal-CVE-2026-9082.py","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/fd89cc2cfe78c9fb7c61a5f098d9b2b1a90af9eb/plugins/drupal/drupal/CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/7h30th3r0n3/CVE-2026-9082-Drupal-PoC","https://github.com/ambionics/cve-2026-9082-drupal-postgresql-rce","https://github.com/N45HT/drupal-cve-2026-9082-checker","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-9082","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-9082","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-9082"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0061","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-23734","title":"XWiki XWiki Platform 路径遍历漏洞","description":"XWiki 平台 ssx 和 jsx 端点存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-23），远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造带有前导斜杠的 resource 参数，利用路径穿越读取 WEB-INF/xwiki.cfg 等敏感配置文件，获取数据库凭证等关键信息可进一步导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 XWiki 16.10.17 以下、17.4.9 以下、17.10.3 以下及 18.1.0-rc-1 以下版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-23734"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-20T20:16:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:22:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 XWiki 至 18.1.0-rc-1、17.10.3、17.4.9 或 16.10.17 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在反向代理层（如 Nginx/Apache）配置规则拦截访问 /bin/ssx/ 和 /bin/jsx/ 路径的 resource 参数含 /../ 或前导斜杠的请求，或通过防火墙限制对 XWiki 管理端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/xwiki/xwiki-commons/commit/a979cafd89f6a9c9c0b9ab19744d672df64429bf","https://github.com/xwiki/xwiki-commons/security/advisories/GHSA-xq3r-2qv5-vqqm","https://jira.xwiki.org/browse/XCOMMONS-3547","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/23xxx/CVE-2026-23734.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/fa30538a41a7f2860cb7778b721229e52f8c6dd2/2026/23xxx/CVE-2026-23734.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897