o Software Center 下载对应版本安装包执行就地升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-csw-pnbsa-g8WEnuy","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-20223.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-20223.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-05-20/TIER_2_CVE-2026-20223.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bb6223196139bc0688b84a1421e9ebaaf1270e61/2026/CVE-2026-20223.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-20223/poc.py","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-20223","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-20223.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-05-22.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/664cbcfd536cb5b218ad44ed120fbb123053c091/cve/CVE-2026-20223.html","https://github.com/OwlsNightCatch/ctipilot/blob/17877868f70606505cf71cffc2ec7a24640f7d8e/entries/2026-05-22/cve-2026-20223-cisco-secure-workload-cvss-10-0-zero-auth-res.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-20223","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-20223"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0059.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0059.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1092","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45495","title":"Microsoft Edge (Chromium) 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2026-45495 是 Microsoft Edge（基于 Chromium）浏览器中的一个远程代码执行漏洞。由于浏览器在处理特定输入时存在不当验证缺陷（CWE-20/CWE-35），攻击者可构造恶意网页内容，诱骗用户使用受影响版本的 Edge 访问该页面，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响未升级至 148.0.3967.70 或更高版本的 Microsoft Edge，攻击向量为网络（AV:N）、攻击复杂度低（AC:L）、无需特权（PR:N）但需要用户交互（UI:R），可导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性完全受损。CVSS v3.1 评分为 8.8，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45495"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-18T18:17:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:52:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 升级至 148.0.3967.70 或更高版本。用户可通过 Edge 菜单的\"帮助和反馈\"→\"关于 Microsoft Edge\"自动下载安装更新；企业环境可通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 或 WSUS 批量部署补丁。临时缓解措施为开启 Edge 的增强安全模式（Enhanced Security Mode），或避免访问不受信任的网站以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-45495","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-454xx/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2026/CVE-2026-45495.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/4b3e998fe7a5b83795af8b4f34211bcf1b8f144b/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-45495/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/2b69dd63395ad7510b86e8c698c785b0ea31ab61/content/posts/cve-2026-45495.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1090","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45494","title":"Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 欺骗漏洞","description":"基于Chromium的Microsoft Edge浏览器存在欺骗漏洞（CWE-79），攻击者可通过构造恶意网页内容，诱骗用户执行特定操作（如点击或输入），从而实施界面伪造或地址栏欺骗等攻击。该漏洞影响运行Microsoft Edge且版本低于148.0.3967.70的Windows系统，攻击复杂度低且无需预先认证，但需要用户交互才能触发。成功利用可导致用户被误导至仿冒网站或执行非预期操作。Microsoft已于2026年5月发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45494"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-18T18:17:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:52:08Z","remediation":"建议将 Microsoft Edge（Chromium 内核）升级到 148.0.3967.70 或更高版本以修复该欺骗漏洞。用户可前往\"设置 → 关于 Microsoft Edge\"自动检查并安装更新，企业管理员可通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 或组策略集中推送补丁。如暂时无法升级，建议在 Edge 中启用增强安全模式或禁用不必要的 JavaScript 以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-45494","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-454xx/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2026/CVE-2026-45494.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/2b69dd63395ad7510b86e8c698c785b0ea31ab61/content/posts/cve-2026-45494.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-45494.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1087","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45492","title":"Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"基于Chromium的Microsoft Edge存在输入验证不当漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标用户发送特制网页内容，当用户使用Microsoft Edge浏览器访问恶意页面或打开恶意文件时触发该漏洞，绕过浏览器内置安全功能限制。该漏洞影响Microsoft Edge浏览器早期版本（低于148.0.3967.70），攻击者需要诱使用户点击恶意链接或访问恶意网站才能利用，攻击成功后可导致浏览器安全防护措施失效，为后续攻击创造条件。Microsoft已在2026年5月15日安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45492"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-18T18:17:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:52:08Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 升级至 148.0.3967.70 或更高版本。可通过设置 → 关于 Microsoft Edge 触发自动更新，或访问 https://www.microsoft.com/edge 下载最新安装包手动升级。如暂时无法更新，建议启用 Edge 的\"增强安全模式\"并在组策略中限制非受信站点的脚本执行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-45492","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-454xx/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2026/CVE-2026-45492.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/2b69dd63395ad7510b86e8c698c785b0ea31ab61/content/posts/cve-2026-45492.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-45492.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0085","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-46333","title":"Linux Linux Kernel ptrace 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ptrace 子系统中的 get_dumpable() 逻辑存在权限管理缺陷。ptrace_may_access() 在对没有内存描述符（mm）的线程（如内核线程）进行访问检查时，错误地使用了本应用于判断进程是否可 core dump 的 dumpable 标志，且传统的 capability 丢弃机制无法阻止该检查。本地攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过权限验证，获取内核线程的敏感信息或实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核版本，Linux 社区已在 6.12.13、6.18.22、6.19.12 及更高版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-46333"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-15T14:16:35Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至安全版本：稳定版升级到 6.12.13 及以上，长期支持版升级到 6.18.22 及以上，最新主线版升级到 6.19.12 及以上。可通过 `uname -r` 确认当前版本，使用发行版包管理器（如 `apt upgrade`、`yum update`）获取更新。如无法立即升级，可临时限制非 root 用户对 ptrace 的访问：通过内核参数 `kernel.yama.ptrace_scope = 1` 写入 `/etc/sysctl.conf` 并执行 `sysctl -p` 生效，阻止非授权进程间调试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01363cb3fbd0238ffdeb09f53e9039c9edf8a730","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/15b828a46f305ae9f05a7c16914b3ce273474205","https://git.kernel.org/stab